# Break / Harden / Certify

Feature completion alone is **not** enough. Every meaningful sprint:

**BUILD → BREAK → HARDEN → POLISH → CERTIFY**

Full matrix: `docs/BREAK_HARDEN_CERTIFY.md` (with `docs/LAYERED_BUILD.md`).

## Do not stop at

UI renders · API 200 · unit test pass · happy path only.

## Before calling GREEN

Happy + negative paths · concurrency/retry where relevant · restart recovery · workspace isolation · security boundaries · UX confusion check · full regression · TEST-workspace cert when provider-facing.

## Always ask

How can this fail? · operator misuse? · other subsystem break it? · process dies? · provider lies/times out? · happens twice? · wrong workspace?

## Bug labels

Severity: `CRITICAL|HIGH|MEDIUM|LOW|COSMETIC`  
Type: `AUTH|WORKSPACE|DATA|RUNTIME|PROVIDER|SCHEDULER|AGENT|UI|CACHE|CONCURRENCY|RECOVERY|CONFIG|OTHER`

No uncontrolled duplicate publishes. Do not blame the operator when the UI can prevent the mistake.
